  "html": "<div style=\"min-height:800px;overflow:clip;background:#000;color:white;position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;\"><nav style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 48px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:white;\">thoughtful</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);\">About Thoughtful</span></nav><div data-el=\"setup-steps\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;padding:18px 48px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;\"><span style=\"display:flex;\"><span style=\"width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:999px;background:white;color:#000;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;\">1</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:white;\">Submit profile details</span></div><span style=\"flex:0 0 40px;height:1px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);\"></span><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;\"><span style=\"display:flex;\"><span style=\"width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);color:rgba(255,255,255,0.45);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;\">2</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.45);\">Connect calendars</span></div></div><main style=\"max-width:720px;padding:36px 48px 48px;box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;\"><h1 style=\"font-size:30px;line-height:1.15;color:white;margin:0 0 8px;\">Submit your profile details</h1><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;padding:22px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:white;\">Name</span><div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:15px;color:white;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;\">Sarah Chen</div><p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);margin:0;\">Your name as members will see it. Include your credentials after your name, like LCSW or PhD.</p></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;padding:22px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:white;\">Headshot</span><div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;\"><div style=\"width:96px;height:120px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\">Photo</div><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);color:white;border-radius:999px;padding:12px 18px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;border:none;\">Upload photo</span></div><p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);margin:0;\">A clear, professional photo with your face centered and a plain background. Ideally 800 &times; 600 px, roughly 5:4. We may edit it to fit our standards.</p></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;padding:22px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:white;\">Bio</span><div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:15px;color:white;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;min-height:120px;align-items:flex-start;\">Seven years of clinical practice in anxiety, depression, and work-related stress.</div><p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);margin:0;\">Your credentials, license type and specialties, in plain text. At least 500 characters. We may edit this to follow best practices.</p></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;padding:22px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:white;\">Personal quote</span><div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:15px;color:white;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;\">I meet people where they are and build from there.</div><p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);margin:0;\">One line about how you work with members. It appears under your photo.</p></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;padding:22px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:white;\">Licensed country</span><div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:15px;color:white;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;\">Type a country</div><div style=\"background:#1c1c20;border-radius:12px;padding:6px;margin-top:6px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;\"><span style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.12);font-size:14px;color:white;\"><b>United</b> States</span><span style=\"padding:10px 12px;font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\"><b>United</b> Kingdom</span><span style=\"padding:10px 12px;font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\"><b>United</b> Arab Emirates</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:6px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;background:white;color:#000;border-radius:999px;padding:6px 12px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;\">United States &times;</span></div><p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);margin:0;\">Start typing and pick each country where you hold an active license.</p></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;padding:22px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:white;\">Licensed states</span><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;background:white;color:#000;border-radius:999px;padding:6px 12px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;\">New York &times;</span><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;background:white;color:#000;border-radius:999px;padding:6px 12px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;\">New Jersey &times;</span><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);color:rgba(255,255,255,0.45);border-radius:999px;padding:6px 12px;font-size:13px;\">California</span><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);color:rgba(255,255,255,0.45);border-radius:999px;padding:6px 12px;font-size:13px;\">Florida</span><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);color:rgba(255,255,255,0.45);border-radius:999px;padding:6px 12px;font-size:13px;\">Texas</span><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);color:rgba(255,255,255,0.45);border-radius:999px;padding:6px 12px;font-size:13px;\">Illinois</span><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);color:rgba(255,255,255,0.45);border-radius:999px;padding:6px 12px;font-size:13px;\">Washington</span></div><p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);margin:0;\">Only for U.S. licenses. Pick each state where you hold an active license. States are grayed out until the U.S. is selected.</p></div><div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);border-radius:16px;padding:18px 20px;margin-top:28px;\"><p style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:white;margin:0 0 6px;\">Thoughtful reviews every profile</p><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);margin:0;\">We reserve the right to edit anything you submit to follow best practices, including your bio, headshot and licensed states. The team reviews every profile before it reaches members.</p></div></main><div data-el=\"action-bar\" style=\"position:sticky;bottom:0;z-index:5;background:#000000;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);padding:16px 48px;box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:24px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);\">Still needed: headshot</span><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.12);color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);border-radius:999px;padding:14px 24px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;\">Save and continue</span></div><footer style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 48px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\"><p style=\"font-size:12px;opacity:0.7;color:white;margin:0;\">&copy; Thoughtful &middot; Provider Portal</p><p style=\"font-size:12px;opacity:0.7;color:white;margin:0;\">Need help? Email providers@springhealth.com</p></footer></div>"
